# RFC-PTCS-DYNAMIC-0036 global resident navigator

## Pre-work plan

- Background: Daedalus and Aster accepted an additive whole-series navigator contract after Renderer/Client 0.2.2 acceptance.
- Goal: add generic whole-series projection and resident relocation action without changing existing behavior when `GlobalOverview=None`.
- Facts: BaseRowId stays on the action; relocation intent carries only revision, generation, start ordinal, and count; inner viewport preserves width and resident-relative offset.
- 假設：reactive SVG replacement 是 active gesture ownership 丟失的共同原因；semantic hit target 與 document-level listeners 可讓 ownership 跨 replacement 維持到唯一 terminal event。
- Scope: owner Contracts, Renderer, Interactive.Client, focused Expecto tests, RFC/current SA/SD/WBS/Test, README/DevLog, package publication after commit.
- Owner boundary: do not modify Research host, port 18884, or Daedalus deployment.
- Acceptance: `GlobalOverview=None` remains byte/behavior compatible; drag updates only global draft; one drop emits one action; matching revision/generation settles; stale/conflict rolls back exactly once; 4500 resident count is not clamped by the 4000 detail limit.
- Risk: wire compatibility and accidental coupling to inner viewport limits.
- Stop condition: contract ambiguity, failing baseline unrelated to this slice, or Daedalus revises the accepted cross-owner contract.

